{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/712157-deed-names-lets-hear-your-best","id":712157,"title":"Deed Names, lets hear your best","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-21T04:05:20-07:00","id":712157,"title":"Deed Names, lets hear your best","content":"Just wanted to hear a few of the best deed names people have come up with. I've had a few, some my own, some from my players. <br /> <br /> Bone Gnawer Ragabash- Demands-No-Pickles (because when someone brought food, his burger always had them) <br /> <br /> Child of Gaia Theurge- Bad Penny (known for being bad luck)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8705-slatezymur","name":"SlateZymur","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T04:12:31-07:00","id":712178,"title":"","content":"Silverfang Ragabash - Stabs-with-Spoons (carried a pair of Fetish silver spoons)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T04:21:45-07:00","id":712180,"title":"","content":"Bonegnawer-Early &quot;strikes a cord&quot; Rumples - Gallard, Honky tonk nobody and pest exterminator extraordinaire, gotta support them two kinfolk ex wives...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T04:27:18-07:00","id":712182,"title":"","content":"Shadow Lord Philodox Metis- Redeems Father's Voice<br /> <br /> A very nitcpicky and scientific minded Ronin Theurge- Questions the Skies<br /> <br /> Ill-bred (as in, BSD stock) Lupus Philodox Child of Gaia- Ragged Eared Bastard<br /> <br /> A poison using Silver Fang Metis- Horned Devil Poisons the Demons<br /> <br /> A Galliard Fenrir Metis with s blood red coat- Gore Singer","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T06:17:46-07:00","id":712301,"title":"","content":"I only ever had one Werewolf character with a Deed Name: I Fell to the Wyrm and Danced the Black Spiral and all I got was this Stupid Name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T10:55:45-07:00","id":712710,"title":"","content":"Here are my players' deed names:<br /> <br /> Mocks-the-Night a Ragabash Shadow Lord, and largely an outsider among his own tribe. He works to unravel the secrets and lies the vile Masks have woven.<br /> <br /> Rends-the-Gar is a Get Ahroun whose first act as a Garou was to help another injured werewolf take down a fallen fish totem.<br /> <br /> Leper-Friend is a Bone Gnawer Galliard who slew a warped vampire that was taking advantage of an impoverished leper colony.<br /> <br /> Hears-the-Song is an Iron Rider Theurge who was first baptized into the world of spirits by hearing the music of the Pattern Web, and she was almost seduced by the Weaver before she fended off its minions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T13:04:47-07:00","id":712928,"title":"","content":"My husband plays an Elder Ragabash Bone Gnawer named Max &quot;Illumination&quot;, as she figured out a way to weaponize UV light with Helios' permission to fight the vamps.<br /> <br /> She used to be Max &quot;Acceleration&quot;, because she drove a car with the spirit of The General Lee in it, but TGL forgives her for switching names.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T13:49:20-07:00","id":712980,"title":"","content":"&quot;Breaks-necks-with-one-hand&quot;, a kickass Silent Striders policewoman with a motorcycle, played by my best friend<br /> <br /> &quot;Kills-with-the-heart&quot;, a grumpy Simba guerrillero, not inspired by The Dark Tower at all...<br /> <br /> &quot;Fast-like-cobra&quot;, a likeable Bagheera gatekeeper<br /> <br /> &quot;Seeks-with-patience&quot;, a not so likeable Bubasti from our group<br /> <br /> &quot;Trails-of-dust&quot;, a really old Silent Striders hermit, last of his pack<br /> <br /> &quot;Spit-back-out-by-darkness&quot;, short &quot;Shadow-barf&quot;, a youngster Ajaba who was rescued from a Wyrm cult and hates his nickname","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/593/w20supporterhiddengarou.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":3312,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3312-taci","user":"Taci","date":". 10-21-2015, 04:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3312-taci","name":"Taci","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3312_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-21T20:51:54-07:00","id":713637,"title":"","content":"I played a Glass Walker Ahroun Metis whose deformity was that in stressful situations he would freeze up and stand there drooling, staring straight ahead. To get him back to reality, someone just had to smack him, usually on the back of the head. His deed name was Reboot.<br /> <br /> In a game I run, a Glass Walker Ragabash used her new gift, power surge, in the school trying to shut down the school's computer. She rolled exceptionally well, and power surged the whole school. Her deed name is Emp.<br /> <br /> <br /> Same game, our Get Ahroun loves his '69 Chevy Chevelle. You can usually find him under the hood. His dream name is Drools on Engine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Reboot","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3684-david-g","name":"David G","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T13:53:14-07:00","id":715367,"title":"","content":"&quot;Drinks-the-River&quot; a Wendigo who was so insulted when a river spirit told him that he was just a small wolf that he stubbornly swallowed the river whole.<br /> <br /> Then there was &quot;Eats-the-Taco&quot; the jerk Ragabash who had to crap on the Wendigo's name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T14:10:38-07:00","id":715454,"title":"","content":"We had some amusing deed-names in our venice campain some time back. Deed-names are in german, so some of the joke may get lost in translation.<br /> <br /> Silent strider Theurge &quot;F\u00e4llt-wie-der-Blitz&quot; (falls-like-the-lightning) in reference on how he is usually the first to go down in battle. Later tryed to get himself a reputation for striking his foes with leaping attack from above.<br /> <br /> Shadow-Lord Galliard &quot;F\u00e4llt-mit-der-T\u00fcr-ins-Haus&quot; (falls-with-the-door-into-the-house). Its a german proverb for being exceptionally blunt and to the point. However it was earned, when he litteraly bodychecked a frontdoor out of its hinges to smash a giant swarm of rats with it, that was overrunning his pack.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6112,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6112-seki","user":"Seki","date":". 10-23-2015, 02:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6112-seki","name":"Seki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T14:59:50-07:00","id":715742,"title":"","content":"Oh boy :3<br /> <br /> I have a bunch of my own and others' posted up in <a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/hall-of-heroes\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> so here are a few I never got around to making glyphed names for:<br /> <br /> <i>She-Who-Speaks-the-Splintered-Tongue</i>. Homid Uktena Galliard &quot;oracle&quot; with a concerning amount of insight <span style=\"font-size:10px\">(even for an Uktena)</span> into the Wyrm, thanks to an insane/corrupt ancestor/past life.<br /> <br /> <i>Follows-Father's-Tracks</i>. Lupus Shadow Lord Theurge, student of <i>Wind-Sends-Grass-Running-With-The-Promise-of-Rain</i>, another Lupus Shadow Lord.<br /> <br /> <i>Crow-of-the-Gallows</i>. Lupus Shadow Lord Ragabash, who happened to have habromania and would uncomfortably giggle-laugh whenever he was excited, nervous or scared.<br /> <br /> <i>One Eye Dry.</i> Homid Corax. This name was a reminder for her to remember that no matter how she felt about a situation, it was her sacred task to retain enough clarity to observe objectively, that bearing witness was more important than anything else. Having spent a great deal of time among Garou and being &quot;infected&quot; with their culture, it was something she had to remind herself of more and more - but aside of one pivotal moment, she always lived up to her name even as her friends were being slain.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T17:09:46-07:00","id":716295,"title":"","content":"Laughs-in-the-Face-of-Death. My very first character many years ago. A Shadow Lord Ahroun that eventually had a cult following..I mean a pack...and a Beta pack. Yep. Two packs who followed his rule and looked to him for guidance and glory against the Wyrm. Years of playing.<br /> <br /> Back-Hands-Kiss. Child of Gaia ahroun that used to give his fists a kiss before knucklin up to lay the war down to lead others to the way of peace. For Gaia!<br /> <br /> Bag-O'S#!t. Bonegnawer Ragabash so named by the two BoneGnawers who found him as a pup in a washed up tied up burlap sack and the conversation between them was &quot;hey lookee at that! Whatcha think it is?&quot; &quot;I dunno. A bag o s#!t???&quot;<br /> <br /> Culls- the two legs- through all Seasons. A Red Talon Theurge who after learning what culling was and when humans did it and why decided to do the same thing to them despite what ever season it was in. <br /> <br /> No-Dice. Galliard Bonegnawer who used to cheat like hell to win at everything, not obviously. Until he was caught out and then admitted he did it all the time. At which point his deedname was changed to 'Loaded-Dice' which went with how drunk he was all the time too.<br /> <br /> Cries-Havok. Metis Glasswalker Galliard that came from blackfury stock...seripus mommy and daddy issues and decided the Wyld was fubard and time to let the weaver in to mop up the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> GryshhGakupGurhk 'Orphan Maker' - BSD in a hellish, event horizon esque game about the Apocalypse from the pov of the Wyrm and its minions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-22T17:24:44-07:00","id":716336,"title":"","content":"Suffers-No-Fools, Homid Philodox Shadow Lord<br /> <br /> Brothers-Friends-Cousin, Homid Glasswalker Galliard<br /> <br /> Born-to-Fury, Metis Silver Fang Ahroun<br /> <br /> Drives-Angry, Homid Glasswalker Ahroun<br /> <br /> He-Shall-Overcome, Homid Child of Gaia Ahroun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","user":"Caitiff Primogen","date":". 10-22-2015, 08:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T00:40:55-07:00","id":717935,"title":"","content":"Peak-of-Purity - Badass Simba Queen<br /> Know-Me - the first Ceilican<br /> Generous-Gift - the last Khara in Europe<br /> Judges-Rain - Nuwisha trouble maker who greets the first Europeans<br /> Distant-Sky - misled Khan who kills Invoked-Honor the surprised Tengu.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-26T01:18:37-07:00","id":728110,"title":"","content":"Ran a game with a Wendigo Galliard called &quot;silver runner&quot; as he ran up a silver chain holding a massive bane in place to tear out its eye. Couldn't walk after that for a week.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/982-cptmachine","name":"Cptmachine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar982_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"44"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T06:00:07-07:00","id":732030,"title":"","content":"Glorious AF.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T06:57:34-07:00","id":732119,"title":"","content":"The local tribe leaders in the first <b>Werewolf</b> game I played in were a study in contrasts:<br /> <br /> Get Of Fenris:<br /> Ronan Honigsman, Clenched Jaw Of The North, Sounder Of Mjolnir's Thunder, Modi Of The Get Of Fenris And Warder Of The Sept Of Warriors' Blood.<br /> <br /> <br /> Bone Gnawers:<br /> Snuff.<br /> (He had a sinus condition.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craig Oxbrow<br /> <b>The Trinity Continuum</b> freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/221-craig-oxbrow","name":"Craig Oxbrow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar221_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"608"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T12:33:14-07:00","id":732823,"title":"","content":"Lupus Bone Gnawer, found abandoned in a card board box as a pup: This-Side-Up","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/767-lostinsanity","name":"LostInSanity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T13:19:45-07:00","id":732942,"title":"","content":"<b>Footsteps-of-Thunder: </b>A Rising auspice Mokol\u00e9 warrior, pivotal in the war against the Dissolver. Archid form is, needless to say, gigantic, armored, a theropod killing machine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T18:28:32-07:00","id":733602,"title":"","content":"One of my favorite characters I've ever played, &quot;Cousin's Boyfriend's Roommate&quot; was a Glass Walker Galliard urban legends expert.<br /> <br /> And a friend once played a Red Talon of the Whelp's Compromise camp who took it upon himself to actively investigate humanity to determine if there were any humans worth saving. His home sept gave him the deed name &quot;Skins the Prey,&quot; a misunderstanding/mistranslation of the expression &quot;wolf in sheep's clothing.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Christopher Shaffer, freelancer. Game line contributions: W20, Night Horrors, TC: \u00c6on, Scion (details <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2019/07/stuff-ive-worked-on.html\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>) <br /> <a href=\"http://mythicfoxwrites.blogspot.com/2020/10/actual-play-index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> <b>Blog post write-ups of my gaming sessions; Currently running Exalted, and also updating old Promethean sessions</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/171-mythicfox","name":"MythicFox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar171_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T05:43:10-07:00","id":734432,"title":"","content":"Fists-of-Oak, a Child of Gaia Ahroun with a specialty in Iskakku staff-fighting - walked softly, carried a big stick.<br /> <br /> TYPES-IN-ALL-CAPS, an eminently dislikable Glass Walker Ragabash.<br /> <br /> Skin-of-Shields, Get of Fenris Metis Philodox with a scaly skin deformity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8485-random_interrupt","name":"Random_Interrupt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8485_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T07:00:58-07:00","id":734612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MythicFox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/712157-deed-names-lets-hear-your-best?p=733602#post733602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And a friend once played a Red Talon of the Whelp's Compromise camp who took it upon himself to actively investigate humanity to determine if there were any humans worth saving. His home sept gave him the deed name &quot;Skins the Prey,&quot; a misunderstanding/mistranslation of the expression &quot;wolf in sheep's clothing.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> I am dying. I am ded. I am typing this from the Dark Umbra.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T09:09:43-07:00","id":738529,"title":"","content":"The most amusing one was my Get of Fenris Modi Mikhal &quot;Pisses-on-the-Wyrm&quot; Ivanova, named after pissing in the eye of a Sabbat vamp who was peeking through a secure door at him. Needless to say said vamp opened the door to the room holding him and a half dozen vamps, all of whom were laughing like crazy. The laughing stopped quickly though, once they realized an angry Russian werewolf had just gained entrance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I'm immortal, I've been right so far&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/301-bwchism","name":"bwchism","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar301_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-29T11:41:58-07:00","id":739113,"title":"","content":"One of my Chars once gained a very similar Deed-Name.<br /> He was just fresh out of char-gen because of the demise of his predecessor, and we had a grand moot.<br /> At the end of it, the whole Sept singled out one nasty Wyrm-Beast as a target for a sacred hunt, and all of us went off to battle it.<br /> It was one giant beast of a Nexus-Crawler, think a Scorpion the size of a big house, easily holding its own against the whole sept.<br /> One of the other players deemed it funny, to pick my terrified small geekisch glass-walker ragabash (who was in lupus form for getting-the-f***-away-from-those-claws), and throw him onto the back of the Nexus crawler.<br /> A few rounds of unsucessfully trying to rake his own claws over the insane armor of the beast my ragabash thought about, how he could possibly hurt this thing... and drew a blank.<br /> He setteled for inconviniencing it instead, and after many a try (and a few close calls with the stinger-tail) pissed the thing right on his many eyes, blinding it for a turn or two.<br /> This allowed the real warriors of the sept the opening, they had been hoping for, and the beast was brought down after heavy fighting.<br /> My char had the dubious honor, to be called &quot;pisses-into-the-wyrm's-eye&quot; ever since.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6112-seki","name":"Seki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T05:33:30-07:00","id":741431,"title":"","content":"I rarely get to play, but I do have a regular group:<br /> <br /> Bone Gnawer Ahroun: &quot;Kisses the Leech&quot; while poor he was extremely attractive during his rite of passage lured a vampire out of a club. While kissing the vampire the rest of cubs attacked.<br /> <br /> Shadow Lord Ragabash: Hunts from Shadows this particular character made a habit of ambushes from Shadows or cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T11:29:03-08:00","id":756988,"title":"","content":"Several characters over the years:<br /> Kanin &quot;Fool's Gambit&quot;, Fianna Homid Ragabash - when setting up to go through his rite of passage, the caern was attacked and he immediately threw himself at the biggest threat (a Zmei) and managed to survive.<br /> Nanook &quot;Tusk-Breaker&quot;, Homid Rokea (of Inuit descent) - This character was from before they really fleshed out Rokea (early 2nd edition I think) who went through his first change after being near fatally wounded by a bull walrus.<br /> Eric (formerly &quot;Mule&quot;) &quot;Wings of Knowledge&quot;, Silent Strider Metis Galliard with vestigial owl wings.<br /> Koen &quot;Storm's Quiet Voice&quot;, Shadow Lord Homid Philodox. Child of Crow and pack Beta.<br /> Nim Powerbar, Ratkin Metis Knife Skulker<br /> Johann Marburg, Ratkin Metis Plague Lord. Marburg disease is somewhat similar to ebola. This character was working on a way to get his disease to act with full effect on vampires.<br /> <br /> I know there are 2 or 3 more I'm forgetting, generally from 1 shots or other short games. Werewolf the Apocalypse has been my favorite of the WoD game lines